When you put on your helm of opposite alignment you'll immediately
lose all your divine protection. And the helm auto-curses so that you
need some means to remove the curse if it ain't the right alignment
on the first tries. If it's going to be your first ascension you might
indeed wish for that helm if you won't find it in the Sanctum or on
the elemental planes. Yes, you can convert at the last moment; I've
done exactly that in my last game[*], spent a wish and put it on.

> Also, blessed fooproof +2 polished sheild, this will let me take my
> amulet of reflect off and use my life saving.

No. The amulet of life saving does not really help you; if you die
once with an amulet you'll also die twice, and then without amulet.

But you will need a stack of blessed potions of full healing! Every
single potion works similar to the amulet of life saving. (In one
respect it works better, maxHP gain, in another respect not so good,
"unexpected" deaths.)

